        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Hyundai Motor Company\n- Products: Hyundai Stellar, Ford Cortina, Hyundai Pony, Kia Bongo, Kia Sephia, Kia Elan, Hyundai Porter, Hyundai Accent\n- Organizations: Hyundai Kia R&D Museum\n- Places: Seoul, South Korea\n- Concepts: rear-wheel drive, mid-size automobile, licensed production\n\nFacts:\n- Hyundai Motor Company is a South Korean multinational automotive manufacturer headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.\n- The Hyundai Stellar was a mid-size rear-wheel-drive automobile produced by Hyundai Motor Company.\n- The Hyundai Stellar was produced to succeed the Ford Cortina that Hyundai had been building under licence.\n- The Hyundai Kia R&D Museum displays vehicles including the Hyundai Pony, Hyundai Stellar, Kia Bongo, Kia Sephia, Kia Elan, Hyundai Porter, and Hyundai Accent.",
